        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana S33Ux-R,  3\" x 3\"x Square Corners Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching steel flathead, Phillips Drive #9 x 3/4\" wood screws. Fitted with a removable hinge pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-S33U-specifications.gif?v=1704354557\" width=\"571\" height=\"266\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana S33U Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3 Inch Steel Door Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.085\" (Residential)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS33U-specifications.pdf?v=1704262440\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana S33U Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
